Student Task Tracker Prototype Description
Project Overview
Student Task Tracker is a web application that helps college students organize assignments, courses, due dates, and completion status.

Target Users
The primary users are college students managing assignments for multiple courses.

Main Screen
The dashboard displays:

Total assignments
Pending assignments
Completed assignments
An assignment entry form
A list of assignments with course names and due dates
Main Features
Add assignments.
Edit existing assignments.
Delete assignments.
Mark assignments as completed.
Filter assignments by completion status.
Store assignments in browser local storage.
User Workflow
Open the dashboard.
Enter an assignment's course, title, and due date.
Add the assignment to the list.
Edit, complete, or delete assignments as needed.
Filter the list to find pending or completed work.
Prototype Purpose
This prototype demonstrates the initial interface and primary interactions. It will be reviewed and improved based on team feedback.